SidecarTridge Multi-device support for Hatari 2.6.1 (EmuMD).
Options --md-firmware/--md-sd/--md-option/--md-verbose, a [MultiDevice]
config section, a .mdfw as the last argument, and the cartridge bank
that routes ROM3/ROM4 to the firmware. build-hatari.sh applies it and
adds multidevice.c, multidevice.h and emumd_plugin.h.

